# Line endings, fixed here rather than left to each contributor's git config.
#
# This project is built on Windows, Linux and macOS from the same checkout. A
# shell script that arrives with CRLF endings fails on Unix with a confusing
# "bad interpreter" error, so everything is normalised to LF in the repository
# and on checkout. The Windows launcher is the exception: cmd.exe wants CRLF.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Anything fetched into the tree is binary and must never be converted.
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
